{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Pc2CDMgQcWmAZwXQu7t9s9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 44 tests pass (0 failures). Here is the review:\n\n# Review: APPROVED\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] `is_light_on(hour_of_day, photoperiod_hours)` helper exists in `light.rs`, centered on noon (8h photoperiod = hours 8–15), used in engine pipeline\n- [x] Reaeration updates `dissolved_oxygen_mg_total` each tick: `delta_do = kLa * (do_sat - do_mg_l) * volume_l` with `kLa` scaling by `top_exchange_factor` and aeration intensity\n- [x] Background BOD subtracted hourly proportional to total biomass (shrimp, plants, microbes, algae) via `respiring_biomass_g`\n- [x] During lit hours, net photosynthetic O2 contribution from plant + periphyton biomass scaled by light intensity\n- [x] DO clamped to non-negative by invariant system (`invariants.rs:4-6`)\n- [x] DIC and alkalinity nudged hourly by respiration/photosynthesis delta; alkalinity feedback proportional to net DIC change\n- [x] pH recomputed from alkalinity and DIC each tick using `6.3 + log10(alk) - log10(dic)` formula, stored as `state.water.ph`\n- [x] `compute_nh3_mg_l(tan_mg_l, ph, temp_c)` shared helper in `chemistry.rs`, used by both event emitter and `TankSnapshot`\n- [x] Event emission: `AmmoniaWarning` at nh3 >= 0.02 (HighAmmonia), `NitriteWarning` at nitrite >= 0.5 (HighNitrite), `OxygenDip` at DO < 4.0 (LowOxygen); deduped per day per kind via `last_event_day`\n- [x] `ProcessParams` extended with all 6 new fields: `reaeration_kla_base`, `aeration_kla_boost`, `background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour`, `plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour`, `respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour`, `photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour`\n- [x] Night oxygen dips observable: `dissolved_oxygen_dips_at_night_relative_to_lit_hours` test passes\n- [x] Aeration effect observable: `aeration_recovers_do_faster_than_passive_exchange` test passes\n- [x] `save_load_resume` test passes (new fields have `#[serde(default)]` for backward compat)\n- [x] `determinism_same_seed` holds (no thread-local RNG in new systems)\n- [x] All 44 existing + new tests pass with 0 failures\n\n## Notes\nClean implementation with well-structured separation of concerns. The decision to keep `ProcessParams::default()` neutral (DIC rates = 0.0) while the TOML preset activates them is a sound compatibility strategy that avoids breaking constructor-based tests while ensuring scenario-driven simulations exercise the full chemistry model. Pipeline ordering (steps 5, 9, 10, 13 before time advance) is correct per the spec.\n\n## Commit Message\nfeat(tank_core): add dissolved oxygen dynamics, hourly pH/DIC updates, light state, and threshold event emission (loop 3)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1558,"cache_read_input_tokens":57245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1558},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1748b4fc-51d6-4391-af57-f472921254b7","uuid":"ec28e324-ea24-46d6-86e2-b8f88830ddc7"}
